This is README of ArcticWolf Assignment.

Assignment has following :
1. server project
2. client project
3. serve config file
4. client config file

NOTE => Make sure to update the path in config files before running the program.

Config files needs to be passed in the CLI command as args in their respective projects.
Client hit the server's POST API when a new file is added in input directory.
This API takes filename and filtered data map.
Server listens to the request and create file in output directory.
It created file with the given filename having filtered data.

To run the programs you will need following
1. Maven installed
2. JDK installed

